OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to do if you didn't get the
OL,4,Aexam results you wanted
OL,5,
OL,6,FExam results days can be times of often
OL,7,Fconflicting emotions for young people.
OL,9,FThe schools where pupils gather with
OL,10,Ffriends to receive their GCSE grades
OL,11,Fwill witness joy, relief, upset and
OL,12,Fsometimes confusion.
OL,14,FExam pressure is all too real among
OL,15,Fteenagers after a nail-biting wait for
OL,16,Fthe results of papers they sat in May
OL,17,Fand June.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
