OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to do if you didn't get the
OL,4,Aexam results you wanted
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities and school counsellors both
OL,7,Fsay they receive an increase in calls
OL,8,Ffrom worried pupils as results day
OL,9,Fnears. Teachers say they too feel
OL,10,Fpressure.
